        <item>
            <title>2.05</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 13:35:08 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>2.05</h2><p class="date">Release date: 15 Sep 2026</p><h3>New in 2.05</h3><ul><li>Custom tab: add your own kinds of files with a path mask in Settings, with a license. Directives, personas, workflows, scripts, wiki pages – each type opens into its files, with tokens and launches for the period.</li><li>Click a file to see where it runs, which skills, commands and agents it was used with, and what was read next to it. Right-click copies the command that runs it.</li><li>Files you attach with @ count as reads now.</li><li>A card in the bell tells you when skills nobody used this month still cost tokens on every request: pause them all or open the list.</li><li>Pause is offered only where it works – Claude Code.</li><li>Long names scroll on hover.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
            <sparkle:version>44</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.05</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
